@startuml 04_webhook_schema

' ============================================================
' Spectre | Webhook Schema
' How webhook delivery works end-to-end with a single client
' ============================================================

' -- Blueprint Style --
skinparam backgroundColor #1B2838
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
skinparam defaultFontColor #D4E4F7
skinparam defaultFontSize 11

skinparam participant {
  BackgroundColor #243B55
  BorderColor #4A7FAD
  FontColor #D4E4F7
  FontSize 11
}

skinparam actor {
  BackgroundColor #243B55
  BorderColor #4A7FAD
  FontColor #D4E4F7
}

skinparam database {
  BackgroundColor #243B55
  BorderColor #4A7FAD
  FontColor #D4E4F7
}

skinparam queue {
  BackgroundColor #243B55
  BorderColor #4A7FAD
  FontColor #D4E4F7
}

skinparam sequence {
  ArrowColor #5B9BD5
  ArrowFontColor #8BAFC4
  ArrowFontSize 10
  LifeLineBorderColor #3E6B9B
  LifeLineBackgroundColor #1E3450
  GroupBorderColor #3E6B9B
  GroupBackgroundColor #15202E
  GroupFontColor #7EB8E0
  GroupHeaderFontColor #7EB8E0
  DividerBorderColor #3E6B9B
  DividerFontColor #7EB8E0
  BoxBorderColor #3E6B9B
  BoxBackgroundColor #15202E
  BoxFontColor #7EB8E0
}

skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #1E3450
skinparam NoteBorderColor #4A7FAD
skinparam NoteFontColor #B0C4DE

title **Spectre -- Webhook Schema**\nServer-to-Server Event Delivery

actor "End User" as user
participant "spectre-snap\nSDK" as sdk

box "Spectre Platform"
  participant "FastAPI" as api
  queue "Redis\n(Broker)" as redis
  participant "Celery\nWorker" as celery
  database "PostgreSQL" as db
end box

participant "Client Server\n(Your Backend)" as client

== 1. Setup (One-Time in Dashboard) ==

note over client
  POST /api/v1/applications
  {
    "name": "My App",
    "webhook_url": "https://api.yourapp.com/webhook"
  }

  Response includes:
  webhook_secret = "whsec_..." (shown once)
  Save this secret to verify signatures.
end note

== 2. Face Verification Trigger ==

user -> sdk : Scan face
sdk -> api : POST /faces/register\nor /faces/authenticate\n(X-API-Key: spk_...)
activate api

api -> api : Liveness check\n(AntiSpoofNetV4)
api -> api : Embedding extract\n(InsightFace)
api -> db : Save session record
activate db
db --> api : session_id
deactivate db

api --> sdk : Response (immediate)\n{ verdict, session_id,\nsimilarity_score }

== 3. Async Webhook Dispatch ==

api -> redis : deliver_webhook.delay(\nsession_id, app_id)
deactivate api
note right of redis
  Fire-and-forget.
  API response already
  sent to SDK above.
end note

redis -> celery : Pick up task
activate celery

celery -> db : Load session + app config
activate db
db --> celery : session data,\nwebhook_url,\nwebhook_secret (encrypted)
deactivate db

celery -> celery : Decrypt webhook_secret\n(AES-256-GCM)

celery -> celery : Build payload
note right of celery
  {
    "event": "face.authenticated",
    "session_id": "abc-123",
    "external_user_id": "user@email.com",
    "liveness_score": 0.97,
    "similarity_score": 0.92,
    "status": "AUTHENTICATED",
    "timestamp": "2026-06-05T12:00:00Z"
  }
end note

celery -> celery : HMAC-SHA256 sign payload\nusing webhook_secret

== 4. Delivery ==

celery -> client : POST https://api.yourapp.com/webhook
note right of celery
  Headers:
  Content-Type: application/json
  X-Spectre-Signature: sha256=<digest>
end note

activate client

client -> client : Verify X-Spectre-Signature\nusing stored webhook_secret
note right of client
  expected = HMAC-SHA256(
    webhook_secret, raw_body
  )
  Compare with header value.
  Reject if mismatch.
end note

client -> client : Process event\n(update KYC status,\ngrant access, log, etc.)

client --> celery : 200 OK
deactivate client

celery -> db : Record delivery\nstatus = DELIVERED
deactivate celery

== 5. Retry (If Delivery Fails) ==

note over celery, client
  If client returns non-2xx or times out:

  Attempt 1: wait 30s  --> retry
  Attempt 2: wait 60s  --> retry
  Attempt 3: wait 120s --> retry
  Attempt 4: wait 240s --> retry (final)

  After 4 failures --> status = DEAD
  Can be retried manually from Dashboard:
  POST /applications/{app_id}/webhooks/deliveries/{id}/retry
end note

== Webhook Events ==

note over api, client
  | Event                | Trigger                     |
  |----------------------|-----------------------------|
  | face.registered      | New face profile created     |
  | face.authenticated   | Face match confirmed         |
  | face.no_match        | Face did not match           |
  | face.spoof_rejected  | Liveness check failed        |
  | face.failed          | Processing error             |
end note

@enduml
